<title>USA: Alliant buys Advanced Tech unit.</title>
<headline>Alliant buys Advanced Tech unit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliant Defense Electronics Systems, a unit of Alliant Techsystems Inc, said Tuesday it has acquired the Lundy Division of Advanced Technology Materials Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Lundy, based in Pompano Beach, Florida, provides chaff, used for protection against missiles, and avionics spare parts.</p>
<p>Alliant said the acquisition will strengthen its position in the growing electronic warfare market.</p>
<p>Alliant Techsystems is an aerospace and defense company.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
